    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join Elaine Choi for a Singsation workshop. It’s a community singing workshop, and a wonderful way to spend a Saturday morning – with people who love to sing! The Theme: Finding Resilience Through Song In October of 2024, conductor, educator, and friend of TMChoir, Elaine Choi was diagnosed with breast cancer. Her public display of..."
